nd-atlas/illinois/mclean-county"],["ARC or PLC in McLean County","/arc-plc/illinois/mclean-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, McLean County has 75 years on record, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 38 of them. In 2025, on the county&rsquo;s middle value, August to September came in at 33% of normal and September to October at 36%. Grid 24467 had its driest year in 2025 at 66%, while the other grids shown had theirs in 1988.</p>"}
